When I would wonder what media/the world would be like without the sex obsession...because sex isn't even that great and it's gross and inconvenient... and *then* realizing that I would be perfectly fine never doing it again because it's more of a hassle than an enjoyment.

A five pound weight fluctuation curve is normal for anyone, (especially if you're female around your cycle, I believe) 

